@@ -13,3 +13,16 @@ A small team notes app. Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind.
 ```bash
 npm run dev
 ```
+
+## Database
+
+Users live in Postgres (Drizzle ORM + `postgres` driver).
+
+```bash
+cp .env.example .env     # set DATABASE_URL
+docker compose up -d     # optional local Postgres
+npm run db:migrate       # apply ./drizzle migrations
+npm run db:seed          # optional: Ada and Grace
+```
+
+After editing `src/db/schema.ts`, run `npm run db:generate` and commit the new migration.
